  {
   "key": "0x07",
   "name": "control reg",
   "access": "write",
   "regions": [
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:RF5C68A.raw.txt",
     "lines": "510"
    },
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:RF5C68A.raw.txt",
     "lines": "520-591"
    },
    {
     "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/rf5c68.cpp",
     "function": "rf5c68_device::rf5c68_w",
     "case": [
      "0x07"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    {
     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The control register at 0007H sets the IC's modes, the waveform memory bank address and the internal memory bank channel.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:RF5C68A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "510",
       "sha": "81613e1b720055e0ae4279df7f81eef338b5881b5056238123768746dd691608"
      },
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:RF5C68A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "520-522",
       "sha": "60b68dc76cb5d6c4a515d14f9d1d4c83e7739e26953ea8bf5ad8c765d0798ccc"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "It is a write-only register.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:RF5C68A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "523",
       "sha": "654233ef2743cbadf10b3ab5ef6864d9d870ed5b471fbadabc1cf9759e895db3"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "bit 7",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Bit 7, the ON/OFF bit, is stored: the IC starts sounding when it is set and stops when it is reset.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:RF5C68A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "528",
       "sha": "244ad9febaefd5e03f9d28c1b64816b1e1647b1851b65669020679843c200d89"
      },
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:RF5C68A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "539",
       "sha": "9498ee9cc36f2d49bab4de2a38c7d2e022df95979d3bf1b82179ee4b133c5a09"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "4",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "External waveform memories can be read only while the IC is not sounding, and writing them while it sounds is restricted.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:RF5C68A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "540-541",
       "sha": "dfebd95f2f5dd278ceed0416e1bb52a9728a75c4cc7a689f67216acabd683964"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "5",
     "on": "bit 6",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "MOD, bit 6, stored, picks the bank register: set, bits 2 to 0 go to the CBs; clear, bits 3 to 0 go to the WBs.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:RF5C68A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "542-545",
       "sha": "d11b978e15e16144f3355a266987f16f1c5471fced7642c40847da48fe4465a7"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "6",
     "on": "bits 2-0",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "With MOD set, bits 2 to 0 are stored as the channel bank that selects the internal memories accessed: value 0 is channel 1 and 7 is channel 8.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:RF5C68A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "549-550",
       "sha": "11fedbd37caf2fa7727bdbbd3451de7c1310ab1615af9f2fae31a1402d8be183"
      },
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:RF5C68A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "553-564",
       "sha": "313a1b0bc3ac95e6a54ffba7997fdc21fa29a983b53439150ea4724201bf43e3"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "7",
     "on": "bits 3-0",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "With MOD clear, bits 3 to 0 are stored as the high address of the external waveform memory, and their value picks memory 1 or 2.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:RF5C68A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "565-575",
       "sha": "897565b7878653b119c790e9699c0e037ff4d5b0994c4f2e0c34416a180f71aa"
      },
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:RF5C68A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "576-581",
       "sha": "faf6c0c76076af0049faa5d3c62e2f7e162b2d985b60e16e7e13af605a19d135"
      },
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:RF5C68A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "582-588",
       "sha": "333be689b2de8c5d773bcd2698acb925514cdc476bef0e619a9e1adcd45bc712"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "8",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "A write to 0007H sets bit 7 as the sounding state, bit 6 as the mode, and bits 3 to 0 as the bank value the mode routes.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:RF5C68A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "520-523",
       "sha": "71ed52b14229e58d9f754a7b4bad23b25b3e270a790ae1f28bca443f5985f1ef"
      },
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:RF5C68A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "539-541",
       "sha": "76d59408052d0d2e80f8ef0a8aa8953bd0c7ce60ad110eb531f57d7ae6530d33"
      },
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:RF5C68A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "542-545",
       "sha": "d11b978e15e16144f3355a266987f16f1c5471fced7642c40847da48fe4465a7"
      },
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:RF5C68A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "565-567",
       "sha": "629c9a729c5cc13de37aa9f7dc3c6b49d1d568a68b88b64334de4a881c7d418c"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "9",
     "on": "read",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "differs",
     "row": "4",
     "text": "MAME reads the waveform memory while the IC is sounding; the read does not test the enable bit.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/rf5c68.cpp",
       "lines": "279-282",
       "sha": "fff3b840522abec4d7e701cef9846de660c75ecd4c7abe721047be0f08fb30fa"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "10",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "differs",
     "row": "4",
     "text": "MAME writes the waveform memory while the IC is sounding; the write does not test the enable bit.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/rf5c68.cpp",
       "lines": "289-293",
       "sha": "256b8e72b466bf0ac009dba14db87c71fa41bbc9bb82935b1d6e8bde265ded65"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
